{"name":"Primavera","hex":"#6fa77a","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Primavera","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Primavera"}],"entries":[{"title":"Primavera (Botticelli)","blocks":[{"text":"Primavera is a large panel painting in tempera paint by the Italian Renaissance painter Sandro Botticelli made in the late 1470s or early 1480s. It has been described as \"one of the most written about, and most controversial paintings in the world\", and also \"one of the most popular paintings in Western art\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Botticelli-primavera.jpg/330px-Botticelli-primavera.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Primavera_(Botticelli)","wikidata":"Q549847"},{"title":"Primavera (software)","blocks":[{"text":"Primavera is an enterprise project portfolio management software. It includes project management, scheduling, risk analysis, opportunity management, resource management, collaboration and control capabilities, and integrates with other enterprise software such as Oracle and SAP’s ERP systems. Primavera was launched in 1983 by Primavera Systems Inc. which was acquired by Oracle Corporation in 2008."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Primavera_(software)","wikidata":"Q2111327"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Botticelli-primavera.jpg/500px-Botticelli-primavera.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Botticelli-primavera.jpg/1280px-Botticelli-primavera.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Botticelli-primavera.jpg/500px-Botticelli-primavera.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_conten